 the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 155% of normal in May to June and 70% in August to September. So far in 2026 January to February came in at 51% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22998 had its driest year in 1988 at 72% of normal.</p>"}
